        {
          "text": "Ka ce gin bino kelo ginnoro me acata baŋwa i ceŋ cabit onyo i nino moro acil, wan gire mom obino wilo gigi-nono. I mwaka me abiro mom obino dok puro pottiwa ame onwoŋo ojeŋo baŋwa, dok daŋ obino jalo banya luŋ ame okoporo-nono.",
